#. ja: 未踏破海域に到達、「<sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0>」を目指して航行します。
#. de: Unbekannte Gewässer erreicht. Nehme Kurs auf: <sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0>.
#. fr: Arrivée dans une zone inexplorée. Mettons le cap vers la destination “<sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0>”.
#. macro: <sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = SubmarineExploration, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "SubmarineExplorationLog:1:0:0"
msgid "Uncharted depths reached. Plotting course to <sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0>."
msgstr "Достигнуты неизведанные глубины. Держим курс на <sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0>."

#. ja: 「<sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0>」に初到達、探索を開始します。
#. de: <sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0> erreicht. Beginne die Erstuntersuchung.
#. fr: Destination atteinte<nbsp>: “<sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0>”. Commençons exploration préliminaire.
#. macro: <capitalize><sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = SubmarineExploration, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "SubmarineExplorationLog:2:0:0"
msgid "<capitalize><sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0></capitalize> reached. Commencing initial survey."
msgstr "<capitalize><sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0></capitalize> достигнута. Начинаем первичное обследование."

#. ja: 「<sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0>」に到達、探索を開始します。
#. de: <sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0> erreicht. Beginne die Unter<shy>such<shy>ung.
#. fr: Destination atteinte<nbsp>: “<sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0>”. Commençons exploration.
#. macro: <capitalize><sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = SubmarineExploration, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "SubmarineExplorationLog:3:0:0"
msgid "<capitalize><sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0></capitalize> reached. Commencing survey."
msgstr "<capitalize><sheet SubmarineExploration $n1 0></capitalize> достигнута. Начинаем обследование."

#. ja: 海流安定、絶好の条件……<string $s1>の「<sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0>」は十分です。
#. de: Gewässer ruhig, Bedingungen optimal. <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> der <i><string $s1></i> ist ausreichend für die Erkundung des Zielorts.
#. fr: Conditions de navigation idéales... <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> de <i><string $s1></i> suffisante.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <string $s1> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = SubmarineSpecCategory, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "SubmarineExplorationLog:4:0:0"
msgid "Seas clear and calm. <i><string $s1></i> <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> sufficient for exploration."
msgstr "Море спокойно. <i><string $s1></i> <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> достаточно для исследования."

#. ja: 大時化発生……「<sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0>」は十分ですが、探索に影響が出ています。
#. de: Starke Strömung entdeckt. <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> des Tauchboots ausreichend, aber eine Beeinträchtigung der Erkundung ist möglich.
#. fr: Subissons grosse mer... <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> de <i><string $s1></i> suffisante, mais influence sur les opérations à craindre.
#. macro: <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = SubmarineSpecCategory, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "SubmarineExplorationLog:5:0:0"
msgid "Experiencing strong currents. Submersible <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> unaffected, but exploratory capability may be slightly hindered."
msgstr "Сильные течения! <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> субмарины в норме, но исследованию это может помешать."

#. ja: 海底火山の活動が活発化……「<sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0>」は十分ですが、探索は非常に困難です。
#. de: Submaritime vulkanische Aktivität entdeckt. <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> des Tauchboots ausreichend, aber eine starke Beeinträchtigung der Erkundung ist wahrscheinlich.
#. fr: Subissons effets d'une éruption sous-marine... <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> de <i><string $s1></i> suffisante, mais conduite des opérations très difficile.
#. macro: <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = SubmarineSpecCategory, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "SubmarineExplorationLog:6:0:0"
msgid "Nearby volcanic activity detected. Submersible <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> unaffected, but exploratory capability may be significantly hindered."
msgstr "Обнаружена вулканическая активность поблизости. <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> субмарины в норме, но исследование может сильно осложниться."

#. ja: 海流安定……「<sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0>」に問題はありません。
#. de: Gewässer ruhig. <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> des Tauchboots ist im Normalbereich.
#. fr: Aucune houle de fond détectée... <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> de <i><string $s1></i> normale.
#. macro: <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = SubmarineSpecCategory, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "SubmarineExplorationLog:7:0:0"
msgid "No prevailing currents detected. Submersible <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> normal."
msgstr "Течений не обнаружено. <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> субмарины в норме."

#. ja: 大時化発生……「<sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0>」に問題はありませんが、探索は非常に困難です。
#. de: Starke Strömung entdeckt. <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> des Tauchboots ausreichend, aber eine starke Beeinträchtigung der Erkundung ist wahrscheinlich.
#. fr: Subissons grosse mer... <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> de <i><string $s1></i> normale, mais conduite des opérations très difficile.
#. macro: <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = SubmarineSpecCategory, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "SubmarineExplorationLog:8:0:0"
msgid "Experiencing strong currents. Submersible <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> normal, but exploratory capability may be significantly hindered."
msgstr "Сильные течения! <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> субмарины в норме, но исследование может сильно осложниться."

#. ja: 「<sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0>」に不安がある状態ですが、探索を強行します。
#. de: <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> des Tauchboots sinkend. Setze Erkundung bis zum Erreichen des Grenzwerts fort.
#. fr: Le sous-marin connaît une perte de <lower><sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0></lower>. Poursuivons la conduite des opérations autant que possible.
#. macro: <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = SubmarineSpecCategory, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "SubmarineExplorationLog:9:0:0"
msgid "Submersible <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> dropping. Continuing exploration until rendered unable."
msgstr "<sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> субмарины ухудшается. Продолжаем исследование, пока она не выйдет из строя."

#. ja: 良質な物を含む「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を発見、念入りに対象を選び回収を開始します。
#. de: Hochwertige <noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1> entdeckt. Beginne Extraktion nach Auswahl der optimalen Probe.
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1></capitalize> de bonne qualité découvert<if "<sheet Item $n1 6>">e</if>s. Commençons extraction sélective.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "SubmarineExplorationLog:10:0:0"
msgid "Several high-quality <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> discovered. Commencing retrieval upon determining ideal sample."
msgstr "Обнаружено несколько образцов высокого качества. Выбираем лучшие и начинаем сбор <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1>."

#. ja: 良質な物を含む「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を発見、回収を開始します。
#. de: Hochwertige <noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 4 1> entdeckt. Beginne Extraktion.
