msgid "Normal <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> result in average retrieval yield."
msgstr "При нормальной <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> собрали среднее количество."

#. ja: 「<sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0>」を考えると、回収量は決して多くは望めません……。
#. de: Verschwindend geringe Ausbeute aufgrund minimaler <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0>.
#. fr: Mise en œuvre médiocre de la <lower><sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0></lower> de l'appareil. Résultat d'extraction très insatisfaisant.
#. macro: <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = SubmarineSpecCategory, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "SubmarineExplorationLog:16:0:0"
msgid "Poor <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> result in disappointing retrieval yield."
msgstr "Из-за низкой <sheet SubmarineSpecCategory $n2 0> улов невелик."

